# Ownership of the automation, policy, and controller surface.
#
# These paths mirror protectedPaths in .github/sdlc/policy.json. That policy
# stops agents editing them at all; this file stops unreviewed human edits
# reaching the default branch. /src/*.ts deliberately matches top-level
# controller modules only, so agent feature work in src/ subdirectories is
# reviewed as ordinary code rather than as a policy change.

/.github/           @dav1dc-github
/src/*.ts           @dav1dc-github
/test/              @dav1dc-github
/package.json       @dav1dc-github
/package-lock.json  @dav1dc-github
/tsconfig.json      @dav1dc-github
